1
00:00:06,216 --> 00:00:09,046
President Seibert, listen to reason.

2
00:00:09,252 --> 00:00:12,222
(Sheldon(on phone):)Yeah, I understand
I don't use the parking spot.

3
00:00:12,422 --> 00:00:14,682
That's not the point. L...

4
00:00:14,891 --> 00:00:18,591
(Sheldon(on phone):)Yes, I'm aware you told me
not to call you at home.

5
00:00:19,095 --> 00:00:20,565
(Sheldon(on phone):)But you didn't answer the door.

6
00:00:22,232 --> 00:00:25,562
(Sheldon(on phone):)And I know you were there
because I saw you through the mail slot.

7
00:00:26,303 --> 00:00:28,633
(Sheldon(on phone):)Yeah, well, that's some salty language.

8
00:00:28,872 --> 00:00:31,772
May I remind you, you're the president
of a major university...

9
00:00:32,008 --> 00:00:34,538
(Sheldon(on phone):)...not the president
of the Potty Mouth Club.

10
00:00:34,744 --> 00:00:36,004
(Sheldon(on phone):)There it is again.

11
00:00:36,213 --> 00:00:38,743
(Sheldon(on phone):)Do you kiss your mother
with that mouth?

12
00:00:39,216 --> 00:00:41,376
(Sheldon(on phone):)Oh. Well, I'm sorry for your loss.

13
00:00:42,052 --> 00:00:43,642
(Sheldon(on phone):)Good night, sir.

14
00:00:43,887 --> 00:00:45,447
(Sheldon(on phone):)Unbelievable.

15
00:00:45,889 --> 00:00:48,019
(Sheldon(on phone):)He says Wolowitz deserves my spot...

16
00:00:48,225 --> 00:00:50,715
(Sheldon(on phone):)...because he's a high-profile asset
to the university.

17
00:00:50,927 --> 00:00:54,587
(Leonard:)Well, he's not wrong. Howard did go
to the International Space Station.

18
00:00:54,798 --> 00:00:56,058
(Sheldon:)That was five weeks ago.

19
00:00:56,266 --> 00:00:58,426
(Sheldon:)How much longer
is he gonna milk that cow?

20
00:00:59,736 --> 00:01:02,026
(Leonard:)Sheldon, let it go. It's not a big deal.

